    "title": "为什么你看了那么多文章，却还是没主见？",
    "content": "<div style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 40px 10px; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; letter-spacing: 0.3px; box-sizing: border-box\"><section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; \"><h1 style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 20px 0; padding: 16px 20px; background-color: #2c3e50; border-radius: 8px; letter-spacing: 2px;\">为什么你看了那么多文章，却还是没主见？</h1><p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你有没有发现，现在网上的观点越来越极端？</p><p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">看一篇文章觉得作者说得对，看另一篇观点相反的，又觉得也有道理。</p><p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">最后自己脑子里一团乱麻，不知道该信谁。</p><p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436;